From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Treggat <taggert2222@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:44:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/27] sycl : XMX (joint_matrix) paths for q4_K/q6_K matmul
 and FA decode

Build option GGML_SYCL_XMX (default OFF). Runtime switches, all default 0:
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_Q4K / GGML_SYCL_XMX_Q6K: exact int8 DPAS matmul for 3..16 columns
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_FA: flash-attention decode for 2..8 query tokens (f16 KV, D=256)
- GGML_SYCL_XMX_GLUE: run GLU/rms_norm/add at 256 GRF next to XMX ops
Also a parked oneDNN u4 path (GGML_SYCL_DNN_U4, default 0) and LOCAL
test-backend-ops cases for the new paths.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.1, Claude Opus 5.5
